			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Paimon",
					"Fatui Skirmisher",
					"Ronin: Anbu"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722740110,
					"content": "This place seems to have its secrets after all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740111,
					"content": "Shh! Listen. There are people talking over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740101
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740101,
					"content": "Gah. Never expected that woman's lips to be sealed up so tight. Not a peep from her at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fatui Skirmisher"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740102,
					"content": "Not to worry, sirs. Interrogation is our specialty. Take a break. We'll take care of this in a moment!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ronin: Anbu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740103,
					"content": "We haven't much time left. The Teacher wants to know how much she knows about our plans, and he wants to know now — or we'll be in hot soup too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fatui Skirmisher"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740104,
					"content": "Gah. His temper is really... something. What in the world did that woman do to anger him so?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ronin: Anbu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740105,
					"content": "The Teacher's latest plans have this person named Lyudochka as a critical piece. But this Shuumatsuban woman took her out!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fatui Skirmisher"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740106,
					"content": "Fortunately, the fire hadn't quite gone out when we rushed in. The Teacher, sharp-eyed as he is, identified Lyudochka from her clothes right away and recognized that our plans might be at risk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fatui Skirmisher"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740107,
					"content": "Bad as that might have been, he really salvaged things, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ronin: Anbu"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740108,
					"content": "Still, we don't know how much of our plans this woman is privy to, or if she's informed anyone else in the Shuumatsuban yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722740109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fatui Skirmisher"
				},
				{
					"id": 722740109,
					"content": "It looks like Momoyo is locked up in an underground cell. Let's get her outta there!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7227402,
